  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-0?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&color=grey\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/princparshia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-Profile-0?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&color=teal\" alt=\"Profile\"></a></p>\n<p>📗 <strong>說明</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>這是為 Bare Bones 材質包打造的精緻附加包，可讓玻璃紋理無縫連接，呈現更簡潔、現代的視覺效果。本附加包在保留 Bare Bones 極簡風格的同時，優化了玻璃方塊與玻璃板的質感，讓您的建築作品呈現流暢且整齊俐落的視覺體驗。</p>\n<p>❗ <strong>安裝需求</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>適用於 Fabric/Quilt：請使用 Continuity</li>\n<li>適用於其他載入器：請使用 OptiFine</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kcbhosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d66\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PrincParshia/Resources/refs/heads/main/OFFICIAL_-_KCB_Hosting_Partnership_Banners_837x80_12.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
